    "detailed_description": "<strong>What genre does the game fall into?</strong><br>The Mirror's End is an adventure game with action elements, featuring a top-down perspective, a visually appealing low-poly art style, and a strong influence from retro gaming. The gameplay revolves around exploration of multiple worlds and incorporates an enjoyable crafting system.<br><br><strong>Will the game have multiplayer capabilities?</strong><br>While multiplayer functionality may be considered in the future, the initial release of The Mirror's End will focus on a single-player experience.<br><br><strong>What is the current development status of The Mirror's End?</strong><br>We have recently finished creating the first demo, known as &quot;Vertical Split.&quot; We are now undergoing a complete refactoring process for both the gameplay and code base. Additionally, we have finalized the captivating story and are eager to share it with you.<br><br><strong>Which platforms will the game be available on?</strong><br>Currently, our target platform for The Mirror's End is Windows. However, we remain open to the possibility of porting the game to other platforms in the future.<br><br><strong>Do you have plans for a crowdfunding campaign?</strong><br>Currently, there are no immediate plans for a crowdfunding campaign, but the potential for such a campaign is not ruled out.",
